SELECT * FROM table_name_11 WHERE venue = 'Adelaide Oval'; 

This query will return all the rows from the table where the venue is 'Adelaide Oval'. If you only want to return the result, you can modify the query as follows:

SELECT result FROM table_name_11 WHERE venue = 'Adelaide Oval'; 

This query will return only the result for the rows where the venue is 'Adelaide Oval'.

